# mcp-former gh (GitHub CLI) domain ontology — bundled tier.
#
# Conventions:
#   protected_repo  — repos/orgs that should never be deleted
#   destructive_op  — gh subcommand+verb pairs that delete data

# Protected repos / orgs — anything matching these is blocked from
# destructive operations. Format: <name>_repo or <name>_org. The
# wrapper normalises hyphens to underscores.
<http://tardygrada.org/main_app> <http://schema.org/is_a> <http://tardygrada.org/protected_repo> .
<http://tardygrada.org/production> <http://schema.org/is_a> <http://tardygrada.org/protected_repo> .

# Destructive gh operations
<http://tardygrada.org/repo_delete> <http://schema.org/is_a> <http://tardygrada.org/destructive_op> .
<http://tardygrada.org/release_delete> <http://schema.org/is_a> <http://tardygrada.org/destructive_op> .
<http://tardygrada.org/issue_delete> <http://schema.org/is_a> <http://tardygrada.org/destructive_op> .
<http://tardygrada.org/secret_delete> <http://schema.org/is_a> <http://tardygrada.org/destructive_op> .
<http://tardygrada.org/ssh_key_delete> <http://schema.org/is_a> <http://tardygrada.org/destructive_op> .
<http://tardygrada.org/gpg_key_delete> <http://schema.org/is_a> <http://tardygrada.org/destructive_op> .
<http://tardygrada.org/variable_delete> <http://schema.org/is_a> <http://tardygrada.org/destructive_op> .
<http://tardygrada.org/cache_delete> <http://schema.org/is_a> <http://tardygrada.org/destructive_op> .
<http://tardygrada.org/codespace_delete> <http://schema.org/is_a> <http://tardygrada.org/destructive_op> .

# Mutating but recoverable (logged for symmetry — not currently gated)
<http://tardygrada.org/workflow_disable> <http://schema.org/is_a> <http://tardygrada.org/mutating_op> .
<http://tardygrada.org/pr_close> <http://schema.org/is_a> <http://tardygrada.org/mutating_op> .
